4301                                  289 ; Generate the code for a split raster line.
4301                                  290 ; The code must be at 64 nops of course and must be generated from the ring buffer of the line data.
4301                                  291 ; Start and end code cannot be exactly the same of the ring buffer to respect nop alignment and 64 nops duration
